  "summary_md": "Today’s batch is defined by a wave of radical strategic reinvention, as multiple companies abandon challenged legacy operations for AI infrastructure, robotics, and crypto treasuries. EVTV has fully shed its electric truck business, merged into Azio AI, and signed an anchor hosting deal. FFAI pivoted from EV to embodied AI robotics, raising shipment guidance after early commercial traction. EMPD is deploying capital into a large-scale AI data center with a triple-net lease from a global tech leader, though elevated short interest signals skepticism. GAME is complementing core gaming momentum with a new Ethereum-based treasury strategy.\n\nA more specialized pivot is unfolding in logistics, where CJMB is retrofitting facilities for cold-chain GLP-1 pharmaceutical distribution, reinforced by insider buying. Organic momentum also surfaces in gaming: SNAL is driving a franchise-led turnaround with ARK expansions and returning to profitability, while MRDN expanded into Brazil’s regulated market and returned to GAAP profitability. In stark contrast, several nano-caps are relying on extreme reverse splits (CENN, GDC) or heavy dilution overhangs (FABC, FWRD) to preserve listings, underscoring a deep divide between operational credibility and speculative repositioning. Execution on these freshly minted pivots will be the critical differentiator.",
